            "review_title": "Review at Six Pub",
            "review_text": "Michael D\nTamborine Mountain, Australia111 contributions\n0\nFelt like a cocktail\nApr 2019 • Couples\nFelt like a cocktail as a holiday treat and this place came up in the search. It is a little tricky to find, you have to go in a building that doesn’t display a sign for Six Pub and up an elevator. \nWhen we got there we were the only customers and the “Duff, duff” loud music forced us on the the balcony to escape it. While obviously the haunt of younger folk, the cocktails were very good and reasonably priced. \nIf they were smart, they would make the place more “mature age” friendly before the younger ones arrived. The enjoyment of sitting quietly with a cocktail cannot be underestimated.\nRead more\nWritten April 10, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
