            "review_title": "Review at Six Pub",
            "review_text": "James H\n50 contributions\n0\nFantastic chilling place and to vape as well!\nMar 2016 • Solo\nIf you are ever in town and looking for some Vape juices to buy. This is the place. Its super relaxing and music is nice. At the ground floor you will see some Korean hair salon, walk straight in and take the lift up to 6th floor. Its an awesome place and you get to sit outside the balcony as well. Best place to chill out and chit chat while enjoying your vape!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 26, 2016",
