            "reviewer_id": "User_8835980_1_5",
            "review_title": "Review at Six Pub",
            "review_text": "Will_We_Survive\nWickham, Australia45 contributions\n0\nA Fun Interesting Evening\nJan 2016 • Couples\nWe were walking back to our hotel one evening when we noticed the balcony of Six Bar and decided to go up and check it out. It is a nice sized place, cosy, but not so small that you don't feel like you cant have a private conversation. The drink selection was good and prices were fair. \nWhen we first arrived they were playing Vietnamese pop music, but then later on I noticed it had changed to Western pop music, which was a plus. This place offers Shisha/Hookah and there was even NOS in balloons if you wanted it. I got the impression that Western customers aren't a regular thing for them, but everyone was really nice and friendly, to the point that instead of staying for the one drink we had planned, we didn't walk out of there until the other side of midnight, haha. Worth a look if near by, on a Wednesday it didn't seem to get busy until about 10pm.\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2016",
